<title>UK: Texaco cut Pembroke runs for two days.</title>
<headline>Texaco cut Pembroke runs for two days.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc reduced crude runs by about 50 percent for two days this week at its 180,000 barrels per day (bpd) Pembroke refinery due to cracker problems, trading sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the refinery in South Wales appeared to have reduced runs by some 90,000 bpd on Wednesday and Thursday after its cracker went down.</p>
<p>The cracker was back on line on Friday, they said. -- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714.</p>
